{"5116470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bassai-Dai", "steam_appid": 5116470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5116470/extras/a2876177c1672545c9365b5a08b10144.poster.avif?t=1787727073\" width=636 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5116470/extras/a2876177c1672545c9365b5a08b10144.webm?t=1787727073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5116470/extras/a2876177c1672545c9365b5a08b10144.mp4?t=1787727073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Paint the World. Master the Elements. Rescue Your Sister.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bassai-Dai is a stylized single-player action-adventure where ink is more than a power: it is your language, your weapon, and your way forward. Wield a legendary brush to reshape the world in real time, draw paths across the landscape, solve elemental puzzles, and unleash expressive combat in a vibrant universe inspired by Greek and Japanese aesthetics.<br>Every stroke matters. Every battle rewards creativity. Every kingdom hides secrets waiting to be revealed by ink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5116470/extras/525f0e4108cd406e442a1d27570c23c6.poster.avif?t=1787727073\" width=640 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5116470/extras/525f0e4108cd406e442a1d27570c23c6.webm?t=1787727073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5116470/extras/525f0e4108cd406e442a1d27570c23c6.mp4?t=1787727073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Single-Player Adventure With Creativity at Its Core</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bassai-Dai is made for players who love:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action-adventure games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets, lore, and progression-driven discovery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where brushstrokes become power, puzzles become language, and every kingdom invites you to paint your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5116470/extras/baf958a2672f820f2410e21a056d3b98.poster.avif?t=1787727073\" width=634 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5116470/extras/baf958a2672f820f2410e21a056d3b98.webm?t=1787727073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5116470/extras/baf958a2672f820f2410e21a056d3b98.mp4?t=1787727073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve challenging environemental puzzles with your ink</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bassai-Dai, ink is the primary language of puzzles. Each kingdom teaches a different elemental logic, and each challenge invites you to think, experiment, and combine powers in clever ways.<br>Master the forces of nature through puzzles based on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire :</strong> ignition, heat, timing, melting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Water :</strong> flow, freezing, reflection, buoyancy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earth :</strong> weight, stability, ancient machinery, hidden paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wind :</strong> momentum, air currents, balance, vertical traversal</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5116470/extras/815f9d9e9b582d51782474e7c775e4d5.poster.avif?t=1787727073\" width=634 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5116470/extras/815f9d9e9b582d51782474e7c775e4d5.webm?t=1787727073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5116470/extras/815f9d9e9b582d51782474e7c775e4d5.mp4?t=1787727073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Journey Through a Hand-Painted World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bassai-Dai features regional hubs connected to branching sub-areas, encouraging exploration and return visits as new powers unlock new possibilities. <br>Return to earlier areas with stronger elemental abilities to: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden shortcuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover optional challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access new secret routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve previously unreachable puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal lore and worldbuilding details</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5116470/extras/7d0b6f23aa34a608ccecc4ddccfc4af3.poster.avif?t=1787727073\" width=640 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5116470/extras/7d0b6f23aa34a608ccecc4ddccfc4af3.webm?t=1787727073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5116470/extras/7d0b6f23aa34a608ccecc4ddccfc4af3.mp4?t=1787727073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A character-driven story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where only a chosen few can wield the 5 elements of nature, Void and his sister Rainbow live quietly near a small town rebuilding after a natural disaster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reserved and withdrawn, Void finds comfort in Rainbow’s warmth and adventurous curiosity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But their fragile peace is shattered when a mysterious enemy invades the village and kidnaps Rainbow. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void must now step outside his comfort zone, face a world he tried to avoid, and find the courage to rescue his sister while uncovering the truth behind the elemental powers within him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5116470/extras/391dcd6e3a08de7777b847d92ad08291.poster.avif?t=1787727073\" width=634 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5116470/extras/391dcd6e3a08de7777b847d92ad08291.webm?t=1787727073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5116470/extras/391dcd6e3a08de7777b847d92ad08291.mp4?t=1787727073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_p